      "text": "Uniform \u2192 unigram \u2192 bigram \u2192\nstructural.  Each plateau tells\nyou what the model has learned\nso far. Read the shape.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Uniform \u2192 unigram \u2192 bigram \u2192\nstructural.  Each plateau tells\nyou what the model has learned\nso far. Read the shape.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
